instrment types (currently crtm_*.vl are all identical - need to verify that
this is accurate)
-To merge the files to generate a file to be used in GEOS, type:
   m4 HISTORY_JOSSE.RC > HISTORY_JOSSE.rc
- .vl : variable list
- .gl : geometry list





